--- !u!114 &890331676
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 890331673}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d69386bbf259070458282b0daae99b17, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    - Pascal
    lines:
    - 'This looks like an investigation board.  There seems to be a mapping of various
      locations marked on the spot. '
    - This part of the board looks highlighted. It appears to be pointing towards
      this old storage house.
    - ( ponder.. )
    - Are the rumors really true? People disappearing? Soldiers gone terminator?
    - ( ponder.. )
    - "There\u2019s no use standing around. The owner of this house seems to be onto
      something. If not now, when again will the mystery be unraveled?"
    - Looking back at the blood splat from earlier, I also wonder if the owner is
      still alive.
    - But first, I need to try and figure out the event that occurred before I arrived
      here.
    - Surely there's some sort of evidence that I could use to make sense of this.
      I wonder if there are any in my suitcase.
    images:
    - {fileID: -9037728103166714318, guid: 68d333ed499c20b449bc0f8569b30a8f, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -9037728103166714318, guid: 68d333ed499c20b449bc0f8569b30a8f, type: 3}
